# CareCompanion User Experience Flow

Version: 1.0

---

# Purpose

This document defines the complete user experience of CareCompanion.

It focuses on

- User Journey
- Screen Behaviour
- User Emotions
- AI Avatar Behaviour
- User Actions
- Edge Cases

This document does NOT describe UI implementation.

It describes the experience.

---

# UX Philosophy

Users should never wonder

"What do I do now?"

Every screen should naturally guide the user toward the next action.

The AI Companion should always feel present, supportive and calming.

