---

# Accessibility Journey

Every important action must be achievable using

Touch

Voice

Visual feedback

Audio feedback

---

# UX Success Criteria

The experience is successful when

Users can complete every major task without external assistance.

Navigation feels natural.

Users always understand the next action.

Accessibility features reduce friction.

The AI Companion feels like part of the experience rather than a chatbot.

